---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Nav from "../components/Nav";
import ClientRouter from "astro/components/ClientRouter.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <ClientRouter />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy — house lights</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#f5f3ef] min-h-screen">
    <Nav current="/privacy" client:load transition:persist />
    <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 pt-16 md:pt-20 pb-24 text-sm text-[#555] leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="font-sans font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-tight text-[#1a1a1a] mb-8">Privacy policy</h1>

      <p class="mb-6">
        house lights is a personal Amsterdam events tracker. This policy explains what data is collected and how it is used.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3 mt-8">What we collect</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
        <li>— Your email address (used only to sign in)</li>
        <li>— A username, optional display name, and optional profile photo you choose</li>
        <li>— Your watchlist entries (shows you've marked as interested, attending, etc.)</li>
        <li>— Your city preferences and venue rankings</li>
        <li>— Who you follow (only visible to you and the people you follow)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3 mt-8">Why</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Solely to provide the watchlist feature. We do not use your data for advertising, analytics, or any purpose beyond the app itself.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3 mt-8">Where it's stored</h2>
      <p class="mb-3">
        Data is stored on <a href="https://supabase.com" class="underline hover:text-[#1a1a1a]">Supabase</a>, hosted in Frankfurt, Germany (EU West). Supabase acts as a data processor under GDPR and we have a Data Processing Agreement in place with them.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-3">Supabase handles the following on our behalf:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
        <li>— Passwords are hashed using bcrypt and never stored in plain text</li>
        <li>— All data is encrypted at rest (AES-256) at the infrastructure level</li>
        <li>— All connections are encrypted in transit via TLS</li>
        <li>— Access is controlled by row-level security policies, so each user can only access their own data</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-6">
        The site is hosted on <a href="https://vercel.com" class="underline hover:text-[#1a1a1a]">Vercel</a> (edge network, EU region where applicable). Vercel does not have access to your personal data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3 mt-8">How long</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">Until you delete your account. You can delete your account and all associated data at any time from <a href="/settings" class="underline hover:text-[#1a1a1a]">account settings</a>. If you joined the waitlist but never created an account, your email will be removed after 12 months.</p>

      <h2 class="font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3 mt-8">Sub-processors</h2>
      <p class="mb-3">We use two sub-processors, both covered by GDPR-compliant DPAs:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
        <li>— <strong>Supabase</strong> (via AWS Frankfurt) — database, authentication, file storage</li>
        <li>— <strong>Vercel</strong> — hosting and edge delivery</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-6">We do not use tracking cookies, analytics, or advertising. No data is shared with any other third party.</p>

      <h2 class="font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3 mt-8">Your rights</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Under GDPR you have the right to access, correct, or erase your data. You can download a copy of all your data or delete your account entirely from <a href="/settings" class="underline hover:text-[#1a1a1a]">account settings</a>. You can also email
        <a href="mailto:dev@claireheaded.com" class="underline hover:text-[#1a1a1a]">dev@claireheaded.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3 mt-8">Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:dev@claireheaded.com" class="underline hover:text-[#1a1a1a]">dev@claireheaded.com</a></p>

      <p class="mt-12 text-xs text-[#aaa]">Last updated July 2026</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
